    "body": "blocked: this issue needs a crash dump from the machine that shows the crash (`bacon`, Intel iGPU). The crash does not occur on the build machine with an NVIDIA card: 10 runs at 12 threads, and the other recipes, gave no crash (see the comment before this one).\n\nNecessary on `bacon`: run the `camcraft-ui` lib test binary with a crash dump on (WER `LocalDumps`, or `procdump -e -ma`), and attach the name of the module that faults. No application window is necessary for this.\n",
