    "body": "New reading from a Windows checkout while gating PR #3626 on 2026-11-23: the STATUS_ACCESS_VIOLATION crash of the camcraft-ui lib suite came in 3 of 4 runs. One run printed all 1431 tests ok and then crashed at teardown (the documented signature). Two runs at --test-threads=4 crashed MID-RUN, not at teardown; one further run at --test-threads=4 was fully green. The single pinning test passes with --exact in every run. So the failure is not bound to the 20-thread default and not always at teardown. No test assertion ever failed. Machine: Windows, rustc stable, the flake reproduces across fresh target dirs.",
