    "body": "Issue sweep: partly done on `main`; this issue stays open.\n\n- Done: PR #3604 (`0839e979e`, for #3589) serialises the GPU lib tests in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/gpu_test_lock.rs`.\n- Done: PR #3907 (`3c1263a58`, for #3605) moves `gpu_guard` to `camcraft_ui::headless_gpu` and locks `trace_composite`, `trace_parity`, `view_pass`, and three ignored lib tests.\n- Still open: `ui suites: egui_app` (`crates/ui/tests/egui_app.rs`) still crashes with `0xC0000005` on Windows (`582981bfa`). Three `--headless` tests (`egui_headless_cli_exit_code_is_zero`, `a_headless_start_with_a_model_file_imports_and_draws_it`, and `a_headless_start_with_a_project_file_opens_and_draws_it`) call `camcraft_ui::run` in parallel and reach `headless_gpu::device()` without `gpu_guard()`.\n- Removed label `blocked`: closed issues #3589 (PR #3604) and #3605 (PR #3907) found the concurrent `wgpu` fault (`d3d10warp.dll`) and added `camcraft_ui::headless_gpu::gpu_guard()`. This issue no longer waits for a crash dump from `bacon`.\n",
